tly there is about 160 million  dollars available for rental assistance  which is expected to be enough to help  40 000 households  and landlords who participate in the  eviction prevention program  will receive the rent owed to them but  there are stipulations in which they  must follow in order to do so  reporting in the studio madison  kimbrough 8 news now
 

